Scene summary: Hook: the night before the district health office evaluates the puskesmas performance, the head of puskesmas stays late in his office; he wants to show that every program's achievement is clear and that he is capable of leading. The product does not appear. 9:16 vertical, realistic live-action, shot on a modern smartphone | Primary Video Type: UGC Native (Malam sebelum penilaian kinerja puskesmas oleh dinkes; kapus ingin terlihat mampu, capaian tiap program harus jelas) + Supporting Format: Product Demo | Locked-off medium shots with a slow push-in in a head of puskesmas office at night, lit by a desk lamp and ceiling light; one close-up of his hand switching on the desk lamp; Seq 3 single static tripod medium shot at the desk. REFERENCE PRIORITY: Use DNA Character as the authority for the talent's FACE and BODY identity only (not the outfit). Use DNA Product as the authority for the exact product identity. WARDROBE below overrides any outfit visible in the DNA Character image. CHARACTER LOCK: Use the DNA Character reference ONLY for the talent's face and body identity: exact face shape, jawline, skin tone, eye shape, eyebrows, hair or hijab style, body proportions and distinguishing features. Do NOT copy the outfit from the reference image; the outfit is defined in WARDROBE below. Keep the exact same face and body throughout the sequence. Do not add accessories or name tags not listed in WARDROBE. WARDROBE (OVERRIDES REFERENCE OUTFIT): Navy blue long-sleeve batik-pattern shirt (subtle pattern) with sleeves rolled to the forearm, dark grey trousers, black shoes, thin silver-rimmed glasses, brown leather watch. No name tag, no lanyard, no white coat. PRODUCT LOCK: Exact Paket Dokumen Inti Kepala Puskesmas ILP 2026 package box from the DNA Product reference image (the real package box mockup uploaded as an ingredient). Preserve the exact box colors, title text, emblem, cover photo, proportions and visible design details exactly as in the reference. Do NOT invent a different box design. It may appear with printed document pages in plain folders and a laptop showing the package's Excel tools (a cluster performance dashboard with red-yellow-green status cells and a 12-month work calendar). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Head of puskesmas office at night: a wooden desk lit by a warm desk lamp, a laptop, a few plain folders, a mug, a dark window behind showing night, a wall calendar (no readable text), quiet and empty building. No other people. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: his hand switches on the desk lamp; cut to medium shot as he looks to the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Besok kinerja saya dinilai dinkes." Delivery (EN): calm, serious 2–4s Problem · medium shot, he opens a plain folder with loose sheets. VO (ID, verbatim): "Mereka mau lihat capaian tiap program." Delivery (EN): honest 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, he flips through mismatched papers. VO (ID, verbatim): "Datanya masih tersebar di mana-mana." Delivery (EN): concerned 6–8s Problem · slow push-in, he looks up at the camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya mau terlihat benar-benar siap." Delivery (EN): quiet, determined 8–10s Beat · medium shot, he takes off his glasses, rubs his eyes, puts them back on. VO: none. AUDIO: Quiet night office ambience, faint crickets outside, desk lamp click. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions, generated text overlays, watermark, poster layout, storyboard panels, or added graphics. Do not invent product details, claims, prices, ratings, testimonials, certifications, or guarantees. Keep exact talent face, the WARDROBE above, product shape, colors, packaging, box title, emblem, document folders, laptop screen content, and visual details consistent with the DNA references.